abstract: >-
  Result-reproduction software for provenance-grounded selective assurance in
  borehole database ingestion. The published Zenodo software archive at
  10.5281/zenodo.22030229 contains version paper4-cageo-v1.0.6; the corrected
  v1.0.8 GitHub release supersedes its submission artifacts without changing
  frozen scientific results. The separately published data-v002 companion is
  10.5281/zenodo.22031703 and remains subject to source-specific terms.
keywords:
  - borehole logs
  - vision-language models
  - provenance
  - selective prediction
  - spatial support
